1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:05,129
Reports answer what the store sold, to whom, and what needs doing.

2
00:00:05,129 --> 00:00:09,315
This video shows how to run and export the commerce reports, how to

3
00:00:09,315 --> 00:00:13,960
put them on the dashboard, and how to start your own from a ready made one.

4
00:00:18,560 --> 00:00:22,962
Reports answer the questions a store owner asks every week:

5
00:00:22,962 --> 00:00:28,110
how much did we sell, and of what, by day, by category and by country.

6
00:00:28,860 --> 00:00:33,098
They tell you who buys, whether they come back, and how many checkouts

7
00:00:33,098 --> 00:00:34,380
end in a payment.

8
00:00:35,130 --> 00:00:37,278
They show what needs doing:

9
00:00:37,278 --> 00:00:42,550
orders still to ship, stock running low, and payments disputed with a bank.

10
00:00:43,300 --> 00:00:47,360
You see the answer on screen, and export it when you want a file.

11
00:00:51,560 --> 00:00:54,337
The order reports come with Orders:

12
00:00:54,337 --> 00:00:58,400
sales, products, customers, tax, refunds and disputes.

13
00:00:59,150 --> 00:01:02,774
Inventory adds stock on hand and stock movements.

14
00:01:02,774 --> 00:01:05,080
Shipping adds shipping times.

15
00:01:05,830 --> 00:01:09,378
Digital downloads and product reviews add a report each:

16
00:01:09,378 --> 00:01:13,440
the links used, and the ratings and reviews waiting for approval.

17
00:01:14,190 --> 00:01:19,296
Subscriptions add new and expiring subscriptions and the revenue they bring.

18
00:01:19,296 --> 00:01:22,970
A report shows up in the menu when its feature is on.

19
00:01:27,158 --> 00:01:31,138
With Reports turned on, open Reports, Commerce, Sales.

20
00:01:31,138 --> 00:01:35,384
At the top, the date range is a drop down of presets, such

21
00:01:35,384 --> 00:01:39,498
as today, last month or this quarter, or your own dates.

22
00:01:39,948 --> 00:01:42,821
Choose Last 30 Days and click Show.

23
00:01:42,821 --> 00:01:45,343
The figures answer the basics:

24
00:01:45,343 --> 00:01:52,138
orders, items sold, the average order value, discounts, shipping, tax, refunds and the net.

25
00:01:52,590 --> 00:01:56,233
Scroll down for the chart, with the day by day sales.

26
00:01:56,233 --> 00:02:02,840
Each currency gets its own figures, because amounts in different currencies are never added together.

27
00:02:03,291 --> 00:02:07,866
Export gives the report as a CSV file, an Excel workbook or a

28
00:02:07,866 --> 00:02:10,187
PDF, laid out like the page.

29
00:02:10,187 --> 00:02:14,351
The Excel and PDF choices come with their own features.

30
00:02:18,552 --> 00:02:23,666
Sales by product shows how many of each product sold, and for how much.

31
00:02:23,666 --> 00:02:27,452
Sales by category shows the same for each category.

32
00:02:29,173 --> 00:02:33,879
Customers shows first time and returning buyers, and your top buyers.

33
00:02:33,879 --> 00:02:38,648
Cohorts and retention groups buyers by the month of their first order.

34
00:02:38,648 --> 00:02:42,853
Checkouts shows how many checkouts were paid, failed or left.

35
00:02:47,225 --> 00:02:51,919
Sales by country, tax on orders, and the VAT one stop shop report,

36
00:02:51,919 --> 00:02:57,135
which gives the figures of the European union return, by country and rate.

37
00:03:05,256 --> 00:03:08,872
Discounts shows what each promotion code took off.

38
00:03:08,872 --> 00:03:11,971
Refunds lists each refund with its reason.

39
00:03:11,971 --> 00:03:17,396
Disputes lists the payments a buyer disputed with their bank, open ones first.

40
00:03:23,892 --> 00:03:28,187
Orders to ship lists paid orders that are not shipped in full, oldest

41
00:03:28,187 --> 00:03:30,649
first, with the days each has waited.

42
00:03:30,649 --> 00:03:33,112
It is the list to start the day with.

43
00:03:33,563 --> 00:03:38,250
With Inventory on, Stock on hand lists every counted item, out of stock

44
00:03:38,250 --> 00:03:43,120
and low first, and Stock movements shows what each item received, sold and

45
00:03:43,120 --> 00:03:46,163
got back, and how many days its stock lasts.

46
00:03:46,615 --> 00:03:51,454
With Shipping on, Shipping times shows how long orders waited to ship, and

47
00:03:51,454 --> 00:03:54,055
how long deliveries took, by carrier.

48
00:03:58,271 --> 00:04:02,888
With the Admin Dashboard on, open Manage Dashboard and Add Widget.

49
00:04:02,888 --> 00:04:07,698
There is a ready made widget for each report, such as sales overview,

50
00:04:07,698 --> 00:04:11,931
top selling products, orders to ship, refunds and low stock.

51
00:04:12,388 --> 00:04:16,503
A Sales Overview widget has a period that moves with the clock, so

52
00:04:16,503 --> 00:04:19,933
last 30 days is always the 30 days up to now, a choice

53
00:04:19,933 --> 00:04:24,048
of figures, tables or charts, and how long it keeps what it shows,

54
00:04:24,048 --> 00:04:26,048
so the dashboard stays quick.

55
00:04:28,472 --> 00:04:31,809
Top Selling Products is a widget in the same way.

56
00:04:31,809 --> 00:04:33,872
Give it a title and publish.

57
00:04:37,689 --> 00:04:40,934
The Report widget shows any report you may view.

58
00:04:40,934 --> 00:04:44,359
Choose the report, and its period and what to show.

59
00:04:50,215 --> 00:04:51,701
Open the dashboard.

60
00:04:51,701 --> 00:04:55,982
Each widget shows its report, and a person sees a widget only when

61
00:04:55,982 --> 00:04:57,825
they may view its report.

62
00:05:02,012 --> 00:05:05,372
To build your own, start from a ready made one.

63
00:05:05,372 --> 00:05:07,908
Under Tools, Recipes, run Reports:

64
00:05:07,908 --> 00:05:09,746
store reports to adapt.

65
00:05:09,746 --> 00:05:15,262
It turns on the Report Builder and adds the order reports as reports of your own.

66
00:05:15,712 --> 00:05:17,768
Open Reports, Report Builder.

67
00:05:17,768 --> 00:05:22,292
The store reports are in the Store group, and they are yours to change.

68
00:05:22,766 --> 00:05:27,819
Run one, or choose Edit to change what it shows, and save it as your own.

69
00:05:27,819 --> 00:05:34,406
The inventory, reviews, downloads, shipping and subscriptions features have recipes of their own.

70
00:05:38,606 --> 00:05:39,934
A weekly look:

71
00:05:39,934 --> 00:05:43,186
sales and orders to ship, on the dashboard.

72
00:05:43,936 --> 00:05:45,330
The tax return:

73
00:05:45,330 --> 00:05:48,116
the one stop shop report, as a file.

74
00:05:48,866 --> 00:05:50,247
Your own report:

75
00:05:50,247 --> 00:05:52,946
copy a ready made one, and change it.

76
00:05:53,696 --> 00:05:55,448
Your accountant:

77
00:05:55,448 --> 00:05:57,756
export to Excel or PDF.

78
00:05:59,756 --> 00:06:04,385
Run, export, put them on the dashboard, and adapt your own.

79
00:06:04,385 --> 00:06:06,236
Thanks for watching.

